WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.412 --> 00:00:15.062
Brad: Come on, Danny: I’ve got it.

2
00:00:15.082 --> 00:00:16.162
Keys! Tina: Keys?

3
00:00:17.343 --> 00:00:19.125
Danny: Yes.

4
00:00:20.005 --> 00:00:21.106
Oh, don’t you see?

5
00:00:21.126 --> 00:00:24.509
Brad: All I can see is that we’re going to be late.

6
00:00:24.529 --> 00:00:26.710
Danny: Just one second!

7
00:00:27.551 --> 00:00:28.892
Danny: There!

8
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.462
See, your imagination will unlock the door.

9
00:00:32.482 --> 00:00:34.664
Danny: What unlocks doors?

10
00:00:35.104 --> 00:00:40.608
Keys! Tina: We’ve got to go, Danny.

11
00:00:40.628 --> 00:00:44.191
Brad: Let’s try to figure this out after school, okay?

12
00:00:45.852 --> 00:00:48.094
Danny: There’s no time.

13
00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:51.156
Tina: Danny, what are you doing?

14
00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:55.660
Brad: I’ve never been in trouble at school before.

15
00:00:56.380 --> 00:01:05.725
Danny: My imagination will unlock the door Tina: What’s that?

16
00:01:05.745 --> 00:01:07.566
Brad: A cloud.

17
00:01:08.127 --> 00:01:10.108
But it’s acting very strange.

18
00:01:11.128 --> 00:01:11.829
Danny: Did it work?

19
00:01:11.849 --> 00:01:15.151
Tina: Only If you imagined rain.

20
00:01:15.171 --> 00:01:19.233
Brad: Strange, very strange.

21
00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:24.496
Danny: Look!

22
00:01:32.544 --> 00:01:32.764
Tina: Wow.

23
00:01:32.784 --> 00:01:34.525
Brad: I knew that cloud looked strange.

24
00:01:34.545 --> 00:01:36.426
Danny: Let’s go!

25
00:01:36.446 --> 00:01:42.708
Brad: Wait, Danny!

26
00:01:43.068 --> 00:01:45.109
What if there are monsters behind there?

27
00:01:45.129 --> 00:01:48.411
Tina: Or what if we can’t find our way home again?

28
00:01:48.431 --> 00:01:52.132
Danny: Look, Hopian is a good giant.

29
00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:53.733
He needs our help.

30
00:01:53.753 --> 00:01:56.654
Danny: Their whole world needs our help.

31
00:01:57.214 --> 00:01:58.615
We can’t let him down!

32
00:01:58.635 --> 00:02:01.156
Tina: He’s right, Brad.

33
00:02:01.516 --> 00:02:03.457
We can’t just stand by and do nothing.

34
00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:05.478
Tina: I’m with you, Danny.

35
00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:10.980
Okay. Me too.

36
00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:18.743
Hello? Hopian?

37
00:02:20.404 --> 00:02:22.585
This isn’t how I pictured Ginormous.

38
00:02:22.605 --> 00:02:25.846
Danny: Maybe we came to the wrong place.

39
00:02:25.866 --> 00:02:29.208
Brad: I think we should go back and try again.

40
00:02:30.136 --> 00:02:32.103
Tina: I don’t think we’re going anywhere, guys.

41
00:02:32.123 --> 00:02:33.729
Danny: Why not?

42
00:02:33.749 --> 00:02:36.499
Tina: Because the door has disappeared!
